x503 write x502 2
x504 text "This is everything a model is told before it writes or edits A0. The sections below say the same thing in full."
x505 puts x503 x504
x506 call close x505 
x507 call open x506 10
x508 write x507 4
x509 write x508 2
x510 text "code wrap"
x511 puts x509 x510
