x691 puts x689 x690
x692 call close x691 
x693 call close x692 
x694 call close x693 
x695 call open x694 13
x696 write x695 4
x697 write x696 1
x698 text "diagnostics"
x699 puts x697 x698
x700 call open x699 11
x701 write x700 2
x702 text "Diagnostics"
x703 puts x701 x702
x704 call close x703 
x705 call open x704 2
x706 write x705 2
x707 text "Every rejection carries a stable code (parse, type, structure, handle, revision, limit), what was expected, what was seen, and the one fix that resolves it. The compiler never guesses: an ambiguous reply is rejected with the fix, not applied approximately."
x708 puts x706 x707
x709 call close x708 
x710 call close x709 
ret x710
end

